Package: ddns-dynv6
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, curl, iproute2
Recommends: network-manager
Suggests: systemd
Description: Dynamic DNS updater for dynv6.com
 Automatically updates dynv6.com DNS records when IPv6 address changes.
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time updates via NetworkManager dispatcher
  - Periodic checks via systemd timer (fallback)
  - Interactive configuration via debconf
  - Journal-based logging